'''The Art of Pokémon the Movie 3: Spell of the Unown''' is an artbook first published by [[Shogakukan]] in Japan and then released by [[VIZ Media]] in English. It is based on the [[M03|film of the same name]] and the [[Pikachu short]] ''[[PK07|Pikachu & Pichu]]''.

The Art of Pokémon the Movie 3: Spell of the Unown consists of a narrated written adaptation of the film accompanied by full-color screen captures from the movie.

